# fresh_dev_suspend_did_without_will: rvg_device_did_resume on a running device with no suspend at all: its root-page write tears the running root FIFO and child FIFO 1 down and clears the enable mark, so no FIFO is rebuilt (0x1000 reads 0, neither NOP is answered); the display page is restored and interrupts are raised.
